{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/httpdestinations\/httpdestination\/dropreports"]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A report of each batch dropped without being delivered, in the order they are dropped."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"dropReports"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/AsyncQueues\/documentation\/AsyncQueues\/AsyncQueue","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV","text":"AsyncQueue"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations\/HTTPDropReport","preciseIdentifier":"s:16HTTPDestinations14HTTPDropReportO","text":"HTTPDropReport"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Encoding"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations\/BatchEncoder\/Failure","preciseIdentifier":"s:16HTTPDestinations12BatchEncoderP7FailureQa","text":"Failure"},{"kind":"text","text":">> { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Reports wait, without a bound, until they are read, so none is missed by reading late.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The sequence ends once the destination and every copy of it are gone and every report has","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"been read. Read the sequence into a constant before starting the task that reads it, so","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the task holds the sequence and not the destination:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"s